evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:152: trailing whitespace.
+AB  - Object detection is a fundamental task in computer vision, aiming to localize and 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:153: trailing whitespace.
+      classify objects within images. Feature pyramid networks (FPNs) play a crucial 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:154: trailing whitespace.
+      role in modern object detectors by constructing hierarchical multi-scale feature 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:155: trailing whitespace.
+      maps to effectively handle objects of varying sizes. However, most existing 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:156: trailing whitespace.
+      advanced FPN methods rely heavily on convolutional neural networks (CNNs), which 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:157: trailing whitespace.
+      struggle to capture global context information. To address this limitation, we 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:158: trailing whitespace.
+      propose leveraging vision mamba blocks to enhance global modeling capabilities. 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:159: trailing whitespace.
+      The vanilla vision mamba block, through its state space mechanism, enables global 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:160: trailing whitespace.
+      context modeling for every spatial pixel within a single feature map. Building on 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:161: trailing whitespace.
+      this, we first use vision mamba blocks to extract global information from 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:162: trailing whitespace.
+      individual feature maps in the hierarchy. Subsequently, additional vision mamba 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:163: trailing whitespace.
+      blocks facilitate inter-scale information exchange among multi-scale feature 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:164: trailing whitespace.
+      maps, ensuring comprehensive global context integration. The proposed method, 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:165: trailing whitespace.
+      termed MambaFPN, significantly enhances object detector performance. For 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:166: trailing whitespace.
+      instance, it improves the Average Precision (AP) of vanilla FPN from 38.6 to 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:167: trailing whitespace.
+      39.4, with fewer parameters. This demonstrates the effectiveness and efficiency 
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:168: trailing whitespace.
+      of MambaFPN in advancing object detection.
evidence/scan-contract/2026-10-29/upstream/capture/pubmed-initial.body:169: trailing whitespace.
